/-- **`ν Johnson.TridiminishedIcosahedron.polyhedron` is the largest scale of the roots of its system**, each of which has exactly one root: the list form of `johnsonTridiminishedIcosahedron_nu_roots`. -/
theorem johnsonTridiminishedIcosahedron_nu_roots_list :
    PolynomialSystem.IsRootMax [johnsonTridiminishedIcosahedron_nu_system_0] Johnson.TridiminishedIcosahedron.polyhedron.nieuwland :=
  PolynomialSystem.IsMaxSingle.isRootMax_of_one_var johnsonTridiminishedIcosahedron_exact_list.1 (by decide) (by decide +kernel)

/-- **System 0 of `ν Johnson.TridiminishedIcosahedron.polyhedron` has exactly one root**: one real point with every variable in its interval solves its equations. -/
theorem johnsonTridiminishedIcosahedron_nu_system_0_oneRoot : johnsonTridiminishedIcosahedron_nu_system_0.HasUniqueRoot :=
