/-- **The Nieuwland number of `Johnson.TridiminishedIcosahedron.polyhedron`, by roots**: `ν Johnson.TridiminishedIcosahedron.polyhedron` lies in `[k, k + 1] / 10 ^ 30`, and it is the largest first coordinate of the roots of finitely many systems of integer polynomial equations, each in a rational box of all its variables and each with exactly one root in its box (`IsPolyRootMax`, `Modules/System/PolyRoot.lean`); the systems are `johnsonTridiminishedIcosahedron_nu_system_<j>`. -/
